 // Project 001: Windows Authentication Investigation
 // Purpose: Verify which computers are sending Windows authentication events.
 // Groups events by computer and Event ID to identify monitoring coverage gaps.
 // Note: The 4-hour lookback reflects the original investigation.

Event
| where TimeGenerated > ago(4h)
| summarize Events = count(), LatestEvent = max(TimeGenerated) by Computer, EventID
| sort by LatestEvent desc
